16. As to what would constitute malpractices, has also been specified in the following terms :-
"2 (f) "Malpractices" shall include the following acts of omission and commission in respect of motor spirit and high speed diesel- (i) adulteration (ii) pilferage (iii) stock variation (iv) unauthorized exchange (v) unauthorized purchase (vi) unauthorized sale (vii) unauthorized Possession (viii) overcharging (ix) sale of off-specification product; and (x) short delivery;
